&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You will be working in a position designed for high-calibre, highly numerate individuals within our quantitative teams. We value free thinkers, and we have created a fast-paced and meritocratic environment where you will be encouraged to apply your own initiative and challenge conventional wisdom.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
